        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Batthyány family\n- Concepts: magnate, nobility, high social status\n- Places: Hungary\n\nFacts:\n- The Batthyány family is an old distinguished Hungarian magnate family.\n- The term magnate comes from the Late Latin word \"magnas,\" derived from the Latin word \"magnus,\" meaning \"great.\"\n- A magnate designates a noble or other man in a high social position by birth, wealth, or other qualities.",
